  "applicationText": {
    "title": "売れ行き",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l44-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "CS公司的新产品——运动饮料在北京和上海上市。销售情况不错。但市场对该产品的命名和图案设计评价如何呢？负责市场调研和广告业务的JC策划北京分公司正在谈论此事。",
        "kana": null,
        "translationZh": "CS公司的新产品——运动饮料在北京和上海上市。销售情况不错。但市场对该产品的命名和图案设计评价如何呢？负责市场调研和广告业务的JC策划北京分公司正在谈论此事。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "CS公司的新产品——运动饮料在北京和上海上市。销售情况不错。但市场对该产品的命名和图案设计评价如何呢？负责市场调研和广告业务的JC策划北京分公司正在谈论此事。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l44-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "在JC策划北京分公司办公室",
        "kana": null,
        "translationZh": "在JC策划北京分公司办公室",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（在JC策划北京分公司办公室）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l44-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "馬",
            "text": "森さん、「動力」、売れ行きが好調のようですね。",
            "kana": null,
            "translationZh": "森先生，“动力”卖得好像不错呢。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "馬：森さん、「動力」、売れ行きが好調のようですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson44/l44-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.7,
              "duration": 3.7,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:30:30.245Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "b8d376e851e711dd3262e5d6974eaa1d219d62a21c7b78a915efb0bf2e3d635b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "ええ、おかげさまで。とりあえず、北京と上海で売り出したんですが、けっこう評判がいいみたいなんですよ。",
            "kana": null,
            "translationZh": "是啊，托您的福。我们首先在北京和上海上市了，评价好像相当不错。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：ええ、おかげさまで。とりあえず、北京と上海で売り出したんですが、けっこう評判がいいみたいなんですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson44/l44-app-block-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 7.26,
              "duration": 7.26,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:30:30.245Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "b8d376e851e711dd3262e5d6974eaa1d219d62a21c7b78a915efb0bf2e3d635b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-003",
            "speaker": "馬",
            "text": "どの辺が受けたんでしょうか。",
            "kana": null,
            "translationZh": "哪一点受欢迎了呢？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "馬：どの辺が受けたんでしょうか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson44/l44-app-block-003-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.78,
              "duration": 1.78,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:30:30.245Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "b8d376e851e711dd3262e5d6974eaa1d219d62a21c7b78a915efb0bf2e3d635b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-004",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "何と言ってもおいしさですが、容器のデザインも好評です。",
            "kana": null,
            "translationZh": "首先当然是好喝，不过容器设计也很受好评。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：何と言ってもおいしさですが、容器のデザインも好評です。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson44/l44-app-block-003-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.1,
              "duration": 4.1,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:30:30.245Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "b8d376e851e711dd3262e5d6974eaa1d219d62a21c7b78a915efb0bf2e3d635b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-005",
            "speaker": "戴",
            "text": "デザインがしゃれていて、人気があるみたいですね。",
            "kana": null,
            "translationZh": "设计很雅致，好像很受欢迎呢。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "戴：デザインがしゃれていて、人気があるみたいですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson44/l44-app-block-003-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.58,
              "duration": 3.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:30:30.245Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "b8d376e851e711dd3262e5d6974eaa1d219d62a21c7b78a915efb0bf2e3d635b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-006",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "そうなんです。それに、ネーミングも受けたようです。",
            "kana": null,
            "translationZh": "是啊，而且命名也很受欢迎。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：そうなんです。それに、ネーミングも受けたようです。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l44-app-block-003-line-006",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson44/l44-app-block-003-line-006.mp3",
